{"id":"e990b1fa5b600f34","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-two-valued-consequence.md","title":"Two-Valued Consequence","display":"df-two-valued-consequence — Two-Valued Consequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-two-valued-consequence","aliases":["93-df-two-valued-consequence"],"display":"df-two-valued-consequence — Two-Valued Consequence","depends_on":["[[93-df-valuation]]","[[93-fact-boolean-2]]","[[93-df-language]]","[[93-df-boolalg]]","[[93-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-two-valued-consequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-two-valued-consequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-two-valued-consequence — Two-Valued Consequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8181bcdfbad8d73a\" href=\"?note=8181bcdfbad8d73a\" title=\"93-df-valuation\">93-df-valuation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e2431dc0f64e0f95\" href=\"?note=e2431dc0f64e0f95\" title=\"93-fact-boolean-2\">93-fact-boolean-2</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> is a language candidate whose projected type is the Boolean type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{\\mathcal L}=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(F_{\\mathcal L}=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{93}\">\\(\\tau_{93}\\)</span> are the language predicate and type projection of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2\">\\(\\mathbf2\\)</span> is the indexed-operation two-element Boolean algebra of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e2431dc0f64e0f95\" href=\"?note=e2431dc0f64e0f95\" title=\"93-fact-boolean-2\">93-fact-boolean-2</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}_{93}\\)</span> is the valuation predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8181bcdfbad8d73a\" href=\"?note=8181bcdfbad8d73a\" title=\"93-df-valuation\">93-df-valuation</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathbf2}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathbf2}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}two\\text{-}valued\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\n\\Gamma\\models^{\\mathbf2}_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)=\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\varphi\\in T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Val}_{93}(v,\\mathcal L,\\mathbf2)\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(v(\\gamma)=1)\n\\to v(\\varphi)=1\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}two\\text{-}valued\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\n\\Gamma\\models^{\\mathbf2}_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)=\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\varphi\\in T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L)}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Val}_{93}(v,\\mathcal L,\\mathbf2)\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(v(\\gamma)=1)\n\\to v(\\varphi)=1\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Consequence quantifies over every valuation from the formula algebra of the displayed language into the designated two-element Boolean algebra. The explicit type equality prevents an empty valuation class from making every consequence vacuously true.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-valuation","status":"resolved","id":"8181bcdfbad8d73a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-valuation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-fact-boolean-2","status":"resolved","id":"e2431dc0f64e0f95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-fact-boolean-2]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"a33dcee0f62c9026","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading"